          "claim": "Freezing prevents top-level changes, does not recursively freeze nested children, and cloning returns a mutable shallow copy."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://rfcs.luau.org/function-table-clone.html",
          "claim": "The clone RFC distinguishes a mutable copy from the original frozen table; shared nested values are not deep copies."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/664.html",
          "claim": "Maps the local API/state boundary; not a deployed exploitation or recall assertion."
        }
      ],
